@startuml "UnitA_OpZ_ActivityDiag.svg"
  title Main
  legend top
    **Thread context:**  Called by one single thread? Thread safe? Called by task or interrupt? Cycle Time?
    Give the name of the task / core / interrupt where the function is called from if possible
  endlegend 
  start
  if (condition?) then (yes)
  :alternative
  calculation;
  repeat
  :**FunctionY**;
  repeat while (x=y?)
  else (no)
  :**FunctionX**;
  :more calculation;
  endif
  :**FunctionZ**;
  stop
@enduml

